From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alastair D'Silva <alastair@d-silva.org>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: a733: reserve BL31 DRAM region

The standalone kernel DTB does not receive the TF-A reservation that
ATF adds to the U-Boot DTB. Reserve the BL31 region so Linux does not
claim memory used by secure firmware.

Signed-off-by: Alastair D'Silva <alastair@d-silva.org>
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733-cubie-a7a.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733-cubie-a7a.dts
index abfd4d86d..f7719b190 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733-cubie-a7a.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733-cubie-a7a.dts
@@ -25,6 +25,17 @@
 		stdout-path = "serial0:115200n8";
 	};
 
+	reserved-memory {
+		#address-cells = <2>;
+		#size-cells = <2>;
+		ranges;
+
+		tf-a@48000000 {
+			reg = <0x0 0x48000000 0x0 0x200000>;
+			no-map;
+		};
+	};
+
 	hdmi_connector: hdmi-connector {
 		compatible = "hdmi-connector";
 		type = "a";
